isement for RBC Royal Bank presenting the bank as a partner for expanding, growing, and pursuing opportunities. The visuals show ordinary branded banking and corporate contexts, including an RBC-associated document and an RBC-branded building. Although the narration is aspirational, the material does not show an investment-return promise, required payment, credential request, or other supported scam mechanism.", "fine_grained_rationale": "The video is a corporate advertisement for a banking service: the narration promotes RBC Royal Bank's assistance to customers, and a supplied frame shows an RBC Royal Bank application form. This supports ordinary services as the main context.", "evidence": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "observation": "The title identifies the video as an RBC Royal Bank corporate television commercial.", "source_id": "TITLE_0001", "quote": "RBC Royal Bank Corporate TVC"}, {"evidence_id": "E002", "observation": "The narration promotes RBC Royal Bank as helping customers expand and grow.", "source_id": "ASR_0001", "quote": "RBC Royal Bank has the global and regional strength. To help you expand and grow."}, {"evidence_id": "E003", "observation": "The narration presents the bank as a partner on a journey toward greater opportunities.", "source_id": "ASR_0001", "quote": "You have a partner with you on your journey. To greater opportunities."}, {"evidence_id": "E004", "observation": "An RBC Royal Bank application form is visible.", "source_id": "F0041", "quote": ""}, {"evidence_id": "E005", "observation": "An RBC sign is visible on a building.", "source_id": "F0047", "quote": ""}]}}
